          "bbox": [
            0.508,
            0.577,
            0.883,
            0.636
          ],
          "content": "6. What are the similarities and distinguishing features in the life cycles of a mosquito and a frog?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.508,
            0.642,
            0.885,
            0.755
          ],
          "content": "7. A plant is provided with all the conditions suitable for its growth (Fig. 10.9). Draw what you expect to see in the shoot and the root of the plant after one week. Write down the reasons."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.508,
            0.762,
            0.884,
            0.857
          ],
          "content": "8. Tara and Vijay set up the experiment shown in the picture (Fig. 10.10). What do you think they want to find out? How will they know if they are correct?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.509,
            0.863,
            0.885,
            0.921
          ],
          "content": "9. Design an experiment to check if temperature has an effect on seed germination."
